🇺🇸🇷🇺Washington's European Proxies Continue Disrupting Maritime Shipping, France Seizes Another "Shadow Fleet" Tanker

▪️France announces seizing yet another "shadow fleet" tanker, a ship ignoring the US and Europe's unilateral and illegal sanctions on Russian energy exports; 

▪️While the US has invested heavily in a "US-EU split" narrative, there is instead a "division of labor" between the US and Europe regarding the US proxy war on Russia in Ukraine and US aggression against Iran and China; 

▪️Despite the "European" label placed on these maritime interdiction operations, it is 100% US policy objectives being pursued - explained in detail in the 2019 "Extending Russia" policy paper published by the RAND Corporation; 

▪️The 2019 paper proposed a proxy war with Russia in Ukraine, placing sanctions and other measures to reduce Russian energy exports, all while creating other crises along Russia's periphery from Europe to Syria to Central Asia;
